<title>USA: NUKO raises $3 mln in private stock sale.</title>
<headline>NUKO raises $3 mln in private stock sale.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>NUKO Information Systems Inc said Friday it had completed a private placement of 1.3 million shares and warrants to acquire another 300,000 shares, raising net proceeds of about $3.0 million.</p>
<p>In a statement, NUKO said it will use the proceeds for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The stock and warrants were sold to two unnamed institutional investors.</p>
</text>
